` fallback so the bundle resolves. The ship"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"ped\n`cordis.patch.yml` mounts a neutral row; point it at your checkout by overlaying\nthe row from yo"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"ur profile's `cordis.patch.yml`:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"The profile patch file is hot-reloaded, so the running GUI picks the plugin up\nwithout a restart. Re"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"start the Harness if you are not on a live profile."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| Key | Default | Meaning |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| `cliPath` | env `ORR_CLI_PATH` | Explicit path to `bin/orr.js`. Overrides `repoRoot`. |\n| `repoRoo"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"t` | env `ORR_REPO_ROOT` | Path to an open-record-replay checkout; the CLI is `<repoRoot>/bin/orr.js"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"`. |\n| `runsOut` | `runs` | Workspace-relative recordings directory. |\n| `skillInputsOut` | `skill-i"},{"id":"p16s4","text":"nputs` | Workspace-relative skill-input packages directory. |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"The CLI runs with the session workspace as its working directory, so recordings\nand skill packages l"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"and where the agent's filesystem tools can read them."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Tools"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"| Tool | CLI mapping | Purpose |"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| `orr_permissions_check` | `permissions check` | Verify Accessibility / Input Monitoring before rec"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"ording. |\n| `orr_record_start` | `record start` | Begin capturing the user's demonstration. |\n| `orr"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"_record_stop` | `record stop` | Finalize the session after the user finishes. |\n| `orr_session_event"},{"id":"p20s4","text":"s` | `session events` | Read the evidence stream (`events.jsonl`), capped at `limit` events. |\n| `or"},{"id":"p20s5","text":"r_session_validate` | `session validate-recording` | Check the recording against the official contra"},{"id":"p20s6","text":"ct. |\n| `orr_skill_prepare` | `skill prepare` | Build the evidence package for the host skill creato"},{"id":"p20s7","text":"r. |\n| `orr_skill_create` | — (built-in) | **Built-in skill creation fallback.** Generates a SKILL.m"},{"id":"p20s8","text":"d skeleton from a recorded session following the Anthropic skills spec (kebab-case name + descriptio"},{"id":"p20s9","text":"n frontmatter, progressive-disclosure body, `evals/evals.json`), validates agent-authored drafts, an"},{"id":"p20s10","text":"d installs to `~/.agents/skills/<name>/`. Prefer a host-native Skill Creator when one exists; this i"},{"id":"p20s11","text":".agents/skills/<name>/`. Prefer a host-native Skill Creator when one exists; this is the fallback. |"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Tests assert the registration contract and exercise the CLI runner through a\nstubbed subprocess serv"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"ice; `node scripts/link-dsh.mjs --path <dir>` points the\n`@deepseek-ai` scope at an explicit DSH che"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"node scripts/link-dsh.mjs --path <dir>` points the\n`@deepseek-ai` scope at an explicit DSH checkout."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"MIT — see LICENSE."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
